":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/559/401/667/696/777/small/76e01e9ff9370f44.png","description":"Frost Nova catching Mary in dot-man"}]},{"id":"117546757936398601","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117546757936398601","createdAt":"2026-11-02T12:06:24.332Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>“Every gun that is made, every warship launched, every rocket fired signifies, in the final sense, a theft from those who hunger and are not fed, those who are cold and are not clothed.”</p><p>I’m going to the Eisenhower Library tomorrow and just found this quote while reading about him. 🤯</p>","media":[]},{"id":"117544677035854359","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117544677035854359","createdAt":"2026-11-02T03:17:12.310Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Hey <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://x-activitypub-bridge.deno.dev/users/20536157\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@<span>Google</span></a></span> your “something went wrong” isn’t cutting it after a dozen tries over multiple days on your privacy page.</p>","media":[{"id":"117544676931655587","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/544/676/931/655/587/original/5829439df120b53e.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/544/676/931/655/587/small/5829439df120b53e.jpg","description":"Google showing me some loading screen that never resolves"}]},{"id":"117539140463859150","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117539140463859150","createdAt":"2026-11-01T03:49:10.927Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Watched House on Haunted Hill (1959). Shockingly spooky. I expected more camp, but this one kept it straight all the way through and it had genuinely scary parts. There was also enough cool camera positioning and good shadows that I looked up the director. Price’s best role I think.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/MovieReview\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>MovieReview</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117539140369642089","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/539/140/369/642/089/original/2f71c874fa282010.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/539/140/369/642/089/small/2f71c874fa282010.jpg","description":"Vincent Price looking like Vincent Price."}]}]},"__N_SSG":true}